# SDD Directory

This directory contains Software Design Documents (SDDs) created by the planning agent
as part of the spec-driven development workflow.

## Naming Convention

- With ticket ID: `{TICKET-ID}-{Feature-Name}.md`
- Without ticket ID: `{Feature-Name}-{YYYY-MM-DD}.md`

## Template

See `.augment/agents/planning-agent.md` for the SDD template structure.

